{"4234930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Lures", "steam_appid": 4234930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/b39554530cc1e04a4b613133f6c0f13c.avif?t=1788246589\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras_big/b39554530cc1e04a4b613133f6c0f13c.avif?t=1788246589 width=1560 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Lures</strong> is a meditative yet demanding fishing adventure set in the heart of the northern wilderness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Life of a Fisherman </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your passion into a profession. Navigate the deep, quiet waters of arctic to fulfill specialized orders for local restaurants and private clients. Every successful haul earns you the capital needed to upgrade your kit, unlock specialized lures and discover untouched fishing spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/c87058b301320c997586f149a86d3a1b.poster.avif?t=1788246589\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/c87058b301320c997586f149a86d3a1b.webm?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/c87058b301320c997586f149a86d3a1b.mp4?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Elements </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing here is a game of patience and precision. These aren't just icons on a map; the fish in Lost Lures fight back. They tire, they struggle and their behavior shifts dynamically based on the time of day and weather<strong>.</strong> <strong>Success isn't luck, it’s an understanding of where the fish hide and when they strike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: keep your prize for profit or practice catch-and-release. While undersized fish are best returned to the water, the giants of the deep will require peak technique and the right preparation to land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/a6417bb315511fa4386571a390ee734b.poster.avif?t=1788246589\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/a6417bb315511fa4386571a390ee734b.webm?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/a6417bb315511fa4386571a390ee734b.mp4?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shared Waters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The northern lakes are vast, but you don't have to navigate them alone. Cast a line in <strong>Online Co-op</strong> for a relaxed afternoon with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is measured in experience and local knowledge. The deeper you venture into the wild, the more the waters will demand of you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Isometric Perspective:</strong> Unique and stylized view of the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Fish actively fight, struggle and tire based on their species and size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Finnish Landscapes:</strong> Explore hand-crafted environments inspired by Finnish nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Progression:</strong> Complete fishing jobs, manage your earnings and unlock professional-grade gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Angling:</strong> Full Online Co-op support and competitive leaderboards</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/b39554530cc1e04a4b613133f6c0f13c.avif?t=1788246589\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras_big/b39554530cc1e04a4b613133f6c0f13c.avif?t=1788246589 width=1560 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Lures</strong> is a meditative yet demanding fishing adventure set in the heart of the northern wilderness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Life of a Fisherman </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your passion into a profession. Navigate the deep, quiet waters of arctic to fulfill specialized orders for local restaurants and private clients. Every successful haul earns you the capital needed to upgrade your kit, unlock specialized lures and discover untouched fishing spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/c87058b301320c997586f149a86d3a1b.poster.avif?t=1788246589\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/c87058b301320c997586f149a86d3a1b.webm?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/c87058b301320c997586f149a86d3a1b.mp4?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Elements </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing here is a game of patience and precision. These aren't just icons on a map; the fish in Lost Lures fight back. They tire, they struggle and their behavior shifts dynamically based on the time of day and weather<strong>.</strong> <strong>Success isn't luck, it’s an understanding of where the fish hide and when they strike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: keep your prize for profit or practice catch-and-release. While undersized fish are best returned to the water, the giants of the deep will require peak technique and the right preparation to land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/a6417bb315511fa4386571a390ee734b.poster.avif?t=1788246589\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/a6417bb315511fa4386571a390ee734b.webm?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234930/extras/a6417bb315511fa4386571a390ee734b.mp4?t=1788246589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shared Waters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The northern lakes are vast, but you don't have to navigate them alone. Cast a line in <strong>Online Co-op</strong> for a relaxed afternoon with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is measured in experience and local knowledge. The deeper you venture into the wild, the more the waters will demand of you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Isometric Perspective:</strong> Unique and stylized view of the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Fish actively fight, struggle and tire based on their species and size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Finnish Landscapes:</strong> Explore hand-crafted environments inspired by Finnish nature.</p></li><li><p class=